<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PyServe Demo</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 3rem auto;
  padding: 0 1.5rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #1a2332;
  background: #f5f7fa;
}
h1 { color: #1677ff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.subtitle { color: #6b7684; margin-top: 0; }
.card {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  margin: 1.5rem 0;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}
code {
  background: #eef5ff;
  padding: 2px 6px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-family: 'Menlo', monospace;
  font-size: 0.9em;
}
a { color: #1677ff; }
ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
li { padding: 0.25rem 0; }
.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 3px 10px;
  background: #d1fae5;
  color: #065f46;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-left: 0.5rem;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>PyServe</h1>
<p class="subtitle">A web server built from scratch in Python <span class="badge">LIVE</span></p>

<div class="card">
<h2>Try the API</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/api/ping">/api/ping</a> — health check</li>
<li><a href="/api/time">/api/time</a> — current server time</li>
<li><a href="/api/echo">/api/echo</a> — see your request headers</li>
<li><a href="/api/users/42">/api/users/42</a> — path parameter demo</li>
<li><a href="/stats">/stats</a> — live server statistics</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Try with curl</h2>
<pre><code>curl http://localhost:8000/api/ping
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/echo -d "hello"
curl -I http://localhost:8000/</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Built with</h2>
<ul>
<li>Raw TCP sockets + threading</li>
<li>HTTP/1.1 parser (no frameworks)</li>
<li>Middleware chain with rate limiting + compression</li>
<li>Path traversal protection</li>
</ul>
</div>
<footer style="margin-top: 3rem; padding: 2rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #6b7684; border-top: 1px solid #e5e9f0;">
